  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>S</mtext><mtext>N</mtext></msub><mtext>2</mtext></math>&nbsp;involves the formation of a pentavalent&nbsp;intermediate, and the reactivity depends on steric hindrance. Lesser the steric&nbsp;hindrance, more is the reactivity of <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>S</mtext> <mtext>N</mtext> </msub> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </math>.<br /><br /><sup><u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/EM0025771_Quest_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 591px; height: 111px;\" /></strong></u></sup></p>",
